    "body": "Note that there is both `max` and `maxlength` attributes already in the spec. `max` is used for range, date and number inputs.\n\nIt might also make sense to use `<input max='5' type='input' multiple>` to restrict it to max 5 files. \n\nIn my mind, that makes more sense than `maxlength`, and probably also more sense than introducing a new property such as `maxcount`.",
